sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Studio API
    participant W as Model worker
    participant S as Local storage
    B->>A: Submit the two photos
    A->>S: Save inputs and create a job
    A->>W: Send person, garment and category
    Note over W: Mac  ·  Klein 9B on Metal<br/>Windows  ·  FASHN on PyTorch
    W-->>A: Return an edited photo or an error
    A->>S: Save a successful result and its finish time
    B->>A: Check job status
    A-->>B: Display the result for comparison
